# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Patient data — NEVER commit.
#
# SDCARD/ is a real Löwenstein prisma card dump: therapy records, device logs
# and a device certificate. The screenshots in docs/screenshots/ are generated
# from synthetic data instead, precisely so this folder never has to be shared.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SDCARD/

# Any other card dump dropped in the working tree.
*.pscfg
*.psstat
*.pscloud
*.wmedf
*.tc
event_*.xml

# Exports produced by the app itself.
cpap-*.csv
cpap-*.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
.env
.env.local

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor cruft
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
System Volume Information/
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
